<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal retail sales fell 8 pct mth/mth in Aug 96.</title>
<headline>Portugal retail sales fell 8 pct mth/mth in Aug 96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's retail sales index fell 8.0 percent month-on-month in August 1996 from July 1996, but retail sales were 7.4 percent up on August 1995, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>INE gave the following figures for retail sales:</p>
<p>					Aug 96	 July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990)	   141.7	   154.1	  131.9</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
